  "testNames": [
    "real signed DATA and independent original pins reach handoff only after key clear",
    "service operations are unavailable before explicit key-closed handoff",
    "wrong independent pins refuse without consuming key close or handoff",
    "changed original bytes challenge or invalid grant refuse before cleanup",
    "unknown funding intake cannot close key as service admission",
    "an unknown clear prevents service acquisition but cannot suppress client stop",
    "synchronous client-close failure still requests the independent key stop once",
    "outer close during signing retains signed DATA and refuses preparation escape",
    "close while preparation is pending waits for the original child operation",
    "clear reentry closes the parent before any child service acquisition",
    "a handed-off input is detached before asynchronous key-close observation",
    "handoff failure is sticky and cannot trigger another handoff or signing",
    "a late child handoff after outer close cannot admit service or upgrade HELD",
    "client closure must return undefined and retain a current clean child view",
    "post-close view drift is retained without rewriting the historical close receipt",
    "unsupported signer completion keeps the actual key HELD despite client close",
    "a second handoff or funding operation cannot reopen the successful service phase",
    "constructor rejects proxy or accessor child methods without entering them",
    "closed native configuration captures the same public selection without key callbacks",
    "active operation reservation rejects reentry without replacing the original",
    "a coherent foreign hash or signature packet cannot replace this wallet result"
  ],
